    "name": "Mather Media Solutions - web tracking v1",
    "description": "Mather Media Solutions web tracking. GA4 configuration plus one event tag and one Custom Event trigger per event emitted by src/lib/analytics/events.ts, plus scroll depth. No Custom HTML tags and no Timer triggers, both by rule. The lead form events are named lead_form_start and lead_form_submit, not form_start and form_submit, because GA4 Enhanced Measurement ships built-ins under those two names and merges them with ours: do not rename them back. No tag sends page_path, page_location, page_title or any other name GA4 reserves, because GA4 discards those at collection and derives them itself. The measurement ID lives in one place, the constant variable 'Const - GA4 Measurement ID'. Google Ads: a Conversion Linker on All Pages, and one conversion tag on form_sent that ships paused, reading its ID and label from 'Const - Google Ads Conversion ID' and 'Const - Google Ads Conversion Label', which hold placeholders until the owner pastes the real values and unpauses it. Import via Admin > Import Container > choose workspace > Merge > Overwrite conflicting. Full instructions in docs/gtm-ga4-setup.md.",
